==Battleground==
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Manager Cat & Clerk Cat (Enemy)|Manager Cat & Clerk Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 1 second<sup>30f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that only requires a bit of strategy. Meatshield with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] + [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and spam [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]. If you're doing this later, you can spam [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]].

